# playx secure env: the key file is local only. This example commits its
# demo .env.secrets and generated file so it runs out of the box; real apps
# should also ignore `.env.secrets*` and `lib/generated/playx_secure_env.g.dart`.
.playx_secure_env.key
secure_defines.json
